  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<color=#39D1BE>SELECT & FOCUS</color>

    Click a model or card. 1-5
    selects your roster; repeat a key quickly or double-click a card to focus. Click
    a stacked tile again to cycle observed characters.


    <color=#39D1BE>PLAN
    ONE ACTION</color>

    Q move / W attack / E skill / R equipment / T wait-cancel.
    Choose an action, then click a tile. Right-click moves immediately. Drag the
    selected character to draw a manual path. REVIVE appears on defeated ally cards.


    <color=#39D1BE>CAMERA
    & TOUCH</color>

    Drag empty battlefield space to pan. Scroll to zoom. On
    mobile: drag to pan, pinch to zoom, drag a selected character to draw a path,
    double-tap a card to focus. Camera controls lock during resolution.


    <color=#E7B768>SOLO
    TESTING</color>

    TAB switches teams; each sees their own field below. ENTER
    locks your team; both ready resolves immediately. P pauses the planning clock.
    SPACE resolves or fast-forwards. VISION toggles clearly marked debug sight. REMATCH
    returns to setup.


    Amber AP is reserved; teal is available. Dark slots are
    empty. Enemy * values are last observed. Local rule assumptions are recorded
    in DevelopmentPlan.md and the configuration asset.'
